{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30639","headline":"虢州献杨抑卿二首 一 · 姚鹄","name":"虢州献杨抑卿二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"盖世英华更有谁，赋成传写遍坤维。\n名科累中求贤日，苦节高标守郡时。\n楼上呌云秋鼓角，林间宿鹤夜旌旗。\n徵归诏下应非久，德望人情在凤池。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚鹄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30639.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30639","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}